Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.03,0:23:40.11,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (bottom right),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs21\pos(497.2,298.8)\fscx56}The Thumb General
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.81,0:23:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

